# Bar Inventory + Bar Manager (remember)

## Goal
Bar Inventory is a **SharedUI** workspace. Admin creates a **Bar Manager** user. That role opens Bar Inventory only on **Mother or Client** (online to Mother). No Client→cloud.

## Phase 0 — product rules (LOCKED)

| Rule | Locked value |
|--|--|
| Role name | **Bar Manager** (`UserRole.BarManager`) |
| Who creates the user | **Admin** (Users / role picker) |
| What Bar Manager can open | **Bar Inventory only** |
| UI home | SharedUI `BarInventoryView` |
| Hosts | Mother thin host (`InventoryPage`) + Client thin host (`BarInventoryPage` / MainPage embed) |
| Capability | `pos.inventory.bar.view` (`PosCapabilityKeys.ViewBarInventory`) |
| Terminal Access feature | `pos.bar_inventory` (`PosFeatureKeys.BarInventory`) — label **Bar Inventory** |
| Mother Admin | Keeps Bar Inventory in Admin sidebar |
| Manager / User / Cashier | No Bar Inventory menu |
| Stock data / wine linking | **Later** — chrome + role first |

### Explicit non-goals (this pass)
- Do **not** build live stock ledger / purchase orders / waste DB yet.
- Do **not** put MySQL inventory rules inside SharedUI.
- Do **not** Client→cloud for inventory.

## Build order
1. **Bar Manager role** + route/capability lock ✅
2. **SharedUI** `BarInventoryView` (replace coming-soon) ✅
3. **Mother** thin host + login → inventory ✅
4. **Client** thin host + Terminal Access feature ✅
5. **Stock APIs / wine model** ← next

## Architecture reminder
Cloud / Mother hub owns future stock truth. SharedUI is chrome only. Bar Manager is inventory-only on both POS hosts.
